<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cue narrows half-yr loss to NZ$1.02 mln.</title>
<headline>Cue narrows half-yr loss to NZ$1.02 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Dec 31.</p>
<p>				(million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				1.02 vs 2.26 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  (1.1) vs (3.9)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 0.1 vs 0.2</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			    1.0 vs 2.3</p>
<p>    Tax					nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    91.3 vs 85.0</p>
<p>Note - Cue Energy Resources NL is an oil explorer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
